      "widgets_values": [
        "A coherent photorealistic 3D clay-render video. Keep the number of people, their positions, poses, gestures and camera framing from the control video. Transform all visible people into smooth matte ivory-white plaster or fine white resin figures, including their skin, faces and clothing. Smooth bald heads with no hair. Preserve detailed eyes, noses, mouths, natural facial expressions, muscle forms and clothing folds. The figures remain fully clothed. Subtle soft gray shading describes the white surfaces. Smooth continuous motion and consistent faces across frames. A saturated green studio backdrop and a dark matte black tabletop in the foreground. Soft studio key light, gentle shadows, clean sculptural surfaces. Preserve the action timing from the source video. No text, no watermark."
